  "historyNote": "#2192, eff 11-25-82; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92 New. #5758, eff 12-20-93, EXPIRED: 12-20-99 New. #8409, eff 8-19-05; ss by #8852, eff 3-24-07; ss by #10267, eff 2-2-13; ss by #13710, eff 8-2-23",
